WEBVTT

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:17.000
I know this cold voice

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Taking my friend

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Maybe a little afraid you'll run away

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:30.000
But right now...

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:35.000
For this moment in time, I want to hold you tight

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:40.000
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:45.000
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:49.000
I'll take off and break all the way

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:53.000
For this moment in time, I just wanna be with you

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:58.000
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:03.000
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:07.000
I know I can change all the way

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:11.000
For the moment...

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:20.000
I just wanna hold you...

00:01:35.800 --> 00:01:38.800
I have to go back.  Whatever it takes.

00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:42.250
But how...?

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:44.300
How can I get out of here?

00:01:45.300 --> 00:01:48.300
How do I catch Lee-Leng Huang off guard?

00:01:52.400 --> 00:01:54.300
I'll have to play a role.

00:01:54.400 --> 00:01:59.300
I'll act the part of the powerless child.

00:01:59.450 --> 00:02:02.100
It's my only chance.

00:02:03.800 --> 00:02:05.000
What shall we do?

00:02:05.200 --> 00:02:08.800
We'll just have to hope Rumaty does something reckless.

00:02:10.250 --> 00:02:12.150
The more the two of them fight, the better.

00:02:12.300 --> 00:02:16.950
It makes them look bad in front of their people and the world.

00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:21.000
Is that where the pure Prince Izmal comes in?

00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:25.000
There's power in little things, right?

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:30.000
However...　whoever we decide we want,

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:33.000
they can't be allowed to poison the King.

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:37.000
A trained parrot is good, but anyone who would be like a toxin...

00:02:37.100 --> 00:02:37.800
we don't need.

00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:48.000
Pride

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:53.000
Did you get one too?

00:02:53.000 --> 00:02:56.000
An invitation to the coronation?

00:02:56.000 --> 00:02:59.000
Yes. They probably sent Kajika one too...

00:02:59.000 --> 00:03:04.000
The ceremony's in a month. Trying to keep Kajika in Raginei, huh…

00:03:04.000 --> 00:03:07.000
Probably so. I could intercept it…

00:03:07.700 --> 00:03:10.700
The risk is the same wherever she is…

00:03:10.700 --> 00:03:13.700
No, it looks like this is an unavoidable trial.

00:03:13.700 --> 00:03:17.700
And Rumaty, how is he? Is he still sulking?

00:03:17.700 --> 00:03:21.700
Not anymore. I just checked on him;

00:03:21.700 --> 00:03:23.700
He listened to me calmly enough.

00:03:23.700 --> 00:03:27.700
Perhaps he’s decided to accept reality.

00:03:27.750 --> 00:03:29.700
I hope so.

00:03:32.100 --> 00:03:32.900
Harry.

00:03:33.200 --> 00:03:33.900
Yes?

00:03:34.700 --> 00:03:37.600
The next King of Raginei...

00:03:38.600 --> 00:03:40.600
Do you think it will be Prince Rumaty?

00:03:42.600 --> 00:03:46.600
God only knows what will happen, Lee-Leng.

00:03:46.800 --> 00:03:48.600
A foolish question.

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:53.000
RAGINEI

00:03:53.100 --> 00:03:55.700
Damn, we made it back.

00:03:55.700 --> 00:04:00.700
That was pretty reckless, marching into the royal house alone.

00:04:01.000 --> 00:04:04.000
What, is the royal family going to act like the Mafia?

00:04:04.500 --> 00:04:07.800
Man!  You don’t know a thing about this country, do you?

00:04:08.950 --> 00:04:10.800
Look around.

00:04:12.800 --> 00:04:17.800
Until 50 years ago, Raginei was a developing country.

00:04:18.800 --> 00:04:23.800
Oil made the country suddenly wealthy, but the people can’t change overnight.

00:04:26.800 --> 00:04:31.800
Plus, the royal family has been doing the living deity thing.

00:04:32.000 --> 00:04:37.000
So… if they wanted, they could have easily taken me out.

00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:39.000
Exactly.

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:42.000
And Prince Somand is the worst, he's a real tyrant.

00:04:42.100 --> 00:04:45.000
Well.  Just be careful from now on.

00:04:49.000 --> 00:04:52.000
Rosenthal is backing Izmal?

00:04:52.450 --> 00:04:56.000
Hm. Maybe Najayra, maybe Izmal.

00:04:56.000 --> 00:05:00.000
Or maybe they'll just back whoever becomes ruler.

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:04.000
Nelson Rosenthal may have aged, but he's still a monster.

00:05:04.400 --> 00:05:07.700
But--the eye of the storm is Najayra.

00:05:07.700 --> 00:05:10.000
She's like an ancient king herself.

00:05:24.750 --> 00:05:27.000
The crimson moon.

00:05:27.000 --> 00:05:30.000
The blood-stained moon.

00:05:37.650 --> 00:05:38.750
Mustafa!

00:05:38.750 --> 00:05:41.750
Hey, Kajika. You didn't go to sleep?

00:05:42.650 --> 00:05:44.750
How could I sleep when I was so worried?

00:05:45.750 --> 00:05:49.750
It was a real ordeal getting into the American ambassador's house.

00:05:50.750 --> 00:05:52.750
Ah--who is...?

00:05:53.650 --> 00:05:57.750
Him? I guess I owe him one now.

00:05:57.750 --> 00:05:58.750
Hi there!

00:05:58.750 --> 00:06:01.750
Eddie Roberts. Paris Newspaper Co--

00:06:01.750 --> 00:06:04.750
--let you go, you're a freelance reporter, right?

00:06:04.750 --> 00:06:06.750
Ah--ah... reporter?

00:06:06.750 --> 00:06:11.750
Yes! It's such an honor that you've agreed to the interview.

00:06:11.750 --> 00:06:13.750
Who agreed to anything of the kind?

00:06:13.750 --> 00:06:14.750
Listen, why don't you--

00:06:14.750 --> 00:06:16.750
It's okay, I don't mind.

00:06:16.750 --> 00:06:19.750
Anyone who helps Mustafa is a friend of mine.

00:06:20.750 --> 00:06:22.550
Absolutely!

00:06:22.550 --> 00:06:24.750
Ah, for the record, who is Mustafa?

00:06:24.750 --> 00:06:26.750
Kajika. A moment...

00:06:27.750 --> 00:06:29.750
Mustafa?

00:06:29.750 --> 00:06:30.750
H--Hey!

00:06:34.000 --> 00:06:35.000
Carl?

00:06:35.000 --> 00:06:39.000
Yes. He said that the debt has been repaid...

00:06:39.000 --> 00:06:41.000
He said that?

00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:46.000
But all I did was help when he felt sick on the elevator...

00:06:46.000 --> 00:06:48.000
So you know?

00:06:48.000 --> 00:06:51.000
The history of Rosenthal and Burnsworth?

00:06:51.000 --> 00:06:54.000
Yes. After I met Carl...

00:06:56.000 --> 00:06:59.000
But... I feel like we could become friends,

00:06:59.000 --> 00:07:01.000
Carl and I.

00:07:09.300 --> 00:07:12.000
Excuse me, Miss Kajika.

00:07:12.000 --> 00:07:14.000
Two letters have arrived for you.

00:07:15.000 --> 00:07:16.000
Letters?

00:07:17.700 --> 00:07:23.000
Tonight, 7pm. Please come to Arie Hall. Najayra.

00:07:23.000 --> 00:07:24.000
Najayra!?

00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:28.000
Huh, working quickly...

00:07:28.000 --> 00:07:30.000
Who is Najayra?

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:33.000
Prince Rumaty's cousin.

00:07:33.000 --> 00:07:36.000
Daughter of Machaty's second wife.

00:07:36.000 --> 00:07:40.000
She's considered holy, a girl who hears the voice of God.

00:07:40.000 --> 00:07:41.000
Wow...

00:07:41.700 --> 00:07:43.000
And the other one?

00:07:43.000 --> 00:07:45.000
An invitation to the coronation, but...

00:07:45.000 --> 00:07:46.800
it's a month from now.

00:07:46.800 --> 00:07:51.800
A month from now? We're leaving tomorrow and they expect us to come back?

00:07:51.800 --> 00:07:56.000
Quite the contrary. They don't want us to leave the country.

00:07:56.000 --> 00:07:57.000
But...

00:07:57.450 --> 00:08:01.800
Probably so. Even if you try to leave, they'll stall you.

00:08:01.800 --> 00:08:06.000
That's absurd. You can't do things like that in the modern world!

00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:07.000
I'll contact the Chairman immediately--

00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:08.000
No.

00:08:09.000 --> 00:08:10.000
Ah--Miss Kajika?

00:08:10.750 --> 00:08:12.000
I will attend the coronation.

00:08:12.800 --> 00:08:15.000
And I'm also going to meet Najayra.

00:08:15.000 --> 00:08:17.000
But... you can't do that!

00:08:17.000 --> 00:08:19.000
I want to meet her.

00:08:20.000 --> 00:08:24.000
That's my wish. To meet Najayra.

00:08:24.800 --> 00:08:28.000
Huh. Looks like she's not letting it go.

00:08:28.000 --> 00:08:31.000
Ahh, Master Lee-Leng is going to be so mad at me...

00:08:31.000 --> 00:08:33.000
Here, take this.

00:08:33.750 --> 00:08:37.000
Well, I'm going to take a nap, wake me up at three.

00:08:37.000 --> 00:08:39.000
Miss Kajika!

00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:44.000
How old is that girl?

00:08:44.800 --> 00:08:46.700
She's fifteen.

00:08:46.700 --> 00:08:49.000
That's why they're so much alike.

00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:50.800
Like Najayra?

00:08:50.800 --> 00:08:56.700
Bingo. Opposites in mood, but a pair. Like positive and negative.

00:08:57.120 --> 00:08:59.000
Plus and minus...

00:08:59.800 --> 00:09:01.000
Oh!

00:09:01.550 --> 00:09:05.000
Two opposites, with such great strength.

00:09:05.600 --> 00:09:08.000
If those two met...

00:09:09.500 --> 00:09:11.700
I have a bad feeling about this.

00:09:14.350 --> 00:09:15.700
Really?

00:09:16.500 --> 00:09:20.700
Yeah... I finally understood what Lee-Leng was saying.

00:09:20.700 --> 00:09:22.700
For a while, I'll live here in America.

00:09:23.000 --> 00:09:25.000
Sorry I've worried you...

00:09:26.000 --> 00:09:27.700
Your Highness...

00:09:27.700 --> 00:09:32.000
By the way, I hear Noei went to Malaysia.

00:09:32.000 --> 00:09:36.000
Yes. From there he plans to smuggle himself into Raginei,

00:09:36.000 --> 00:09:39.000
to try to reason with Prince Somand.

00:09:43.400 --> 00:09:47.000
But wait, when did he make all these preparations?

00:09:47.000 --> 00:09:52.000
It seems he met up at a pub with a man who had come to threaten Master Eugene,

00:09:52.000 --> 00:09:55.000
and that man told him about a secret route.

00:09:56.000 --> 00:09:59.000
A man of deeds, not words.

00:09:59.000 --> 00:10:01.000
And Lee-Leng knows that story?

00:10:01.000 --> 00:10:03.000
No... not yet...

00:10:04.000 --> 00:10:09.000
That man... he'll find out sooner or later.

00:10:09.000 --> 00:10:12.000
It would be wise to keep it quiet.

00:10:19.250 --> 00:10:21.000
Here!

00:10:21.500 --> 00:10:22.800
What's--?

00:10:22.800 --> 00:10:26.000
Give this to the man from the pub, to keep quiet.

00:10:26.000 --> 00:10:28.000
What is his name?

00:10:28.000 --> 00:10:30.000
I think it was Harper.

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:34.000
He said he'd be at a store called Nova, in Queens.

00:10:34.000 --> 00:10:35.000
Can you make it?

00:10:35.250 --> 00:10:41.000
Sure. New York is a melting pot. Once I change, I'll blend in.

00:10:41.000 --> 00:10:44.000
I see... but what will you say to security?

00:10:44.500 --> 00:10:50.000
I'll be fine. I know them, so as long as I call beforehand...

00:10:50.500 --> 00:10:54.000
Well, then. I'm going to go get ready.

00:11:00.300 --> 00:11:02.000
Forgive me, Sezun.

00:11:04.500 --> 00:11:05.000
Name?

00:11:05.300 --> 00:11:08.000
Ernest is my name.

00:11:08.000 --> 00:11:12.000
It's an honor to serve as your bodyguard.

00:11:12.000 --> 00:11:15.000
Is that so?

00:11:15.500 --> 00:11:20.500
My bodyguards have nothing to do, so you may just get the run around.

00:11:20.500 --> 00:11:23.000
Eh? Really?

00:11:24.000 --> 00:11:26.000
I've made the arrangements.

00:11:26.000 --> 00:11:31.000
It's all set for a week from now, but isn't the coronation in a month?

00:11:31.100 --> 00:11:35.700
According to Toranosuke, Najayra has her eye on Kajika.

00:11:36.150 --> 00:11:42.000
A mysterious princess... the sooner we meet her, the better.

00:11:44.000 --> 00:11:45.000
Mm? What?

00:11:45.000 --> 00:11:51.000
Nothing... but if even you are going to Raginei, he's not going to be very happy...

00:11:51.400 --> 00:11:55.000
Yes, that's definitely going to be a problem...

00:11:55.550 --> 00:11:59.000
Oh well. I guess I'd better go appease the Prince.

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:01.000
Heh.

00:12:01.500 --> 00:12:03.000
What now?

00:12:03.000 --> 00:12:07.000
Oh, nothing. I was just thinking how happy you look.

00:12:07.000 --> 00:12:09.000
Happy?

00:12:09.000 --> 00:12:11.000
Ha. Ridiculous.

00:12:11.000 --> 00:12:14.000
I'm going to go get cursed out.

00:12:20.000 --> 00:12:23.000
Um, should I go with him?

00:12:24.550 --> 00:12:26.000
Chief.

00:12:27.000 --> 00:12:29.500
Sezun? Is he alone?

00:12:29.500 --> 00:12:30.450
Yes.

00:12:30.450 --> 00:12:32.000
Alright, open it up.

00:12:38.000 --> 00:12:40.000
I understand what Lee-Leng is saying, but...

00:12:40.000 --> 00:12:45.000
my pride won’t allow me to be used by Burnsworth.

00:12:45.400 --> 00:12:48.600
A corporation doesn’t operate without profit.

00:12:49.600 --> 00:12:51.000
Harry Burnsworth...

00:12:51.550 --> 00:12:55.000
He’s going to make me a pawn in his power game.

00:12:56.800 --> 00:12:58.000
I won't do it!

00:13:03.700 --> 00:13:05.000
Hey, what's his hurry?

00:13:05.500 --> 00:13:07.000
They're probably rushing him?

00:13:09.500 --> 00:13:11.000
Hello, Security.

00:13:11.000 --> 00:13:13.000
John? Did someone just leave?

00:13:13.400 --> 00:13:17.500
Yes, Sezun just left. He was properly disguised.

00:13:18.000 --> 00:13:20.000
Ah! Too late!

00:13:20.650 --> 00:13:24.000
That was Prince Rumaty! Go after him!

00:13:27.600 --> 00:13:30.000
Perhaps I was too easy on him...

00:13:44.650 --> 00:13:45.500
I'm free.

00:13:46.600 --> 00:13:48.000
I'm free!

00:13:51.400 --> 00:13:52.000
What do you think?

00:13:52.500 --> 00:13:55.000
Hm? Looks like him.

00:13:55.800 --> 00:13:58.000
$100,000...

00:14:07.650 --> 00:14:11.000
At any rate, first of all I have to get to New York.

00:14:22.500 --> 00:14:24.900
Hey kid, where you headed?

00:14:24.900 --> 00:14:27.000
Qu--Queens.

00:14:27.000 --> 00:14:29.000
I'm headed past there. Hop in.

00:14:31.000 --> 00:14:34.000
Is that!?  Your Highness!

00:14:34.000 --> 00:14:36.000
Caught already?

00:14:38.650 --> 00:14:40.000
Your Highness!

00:14:45.250 --> 00:14:46.250
That way!

00:14:49.000 --> 00:14:50.000
What was that?

00:14:50.000 --> 00:14:51.000
Don't worry about it.

00:14:51.600 --> 00:14:54.000
’Scuse me, do you think you could hurry?

00:14:54.000 --> 00:14:56.000
I don't have any cash, but I'd be grateful...

00:14:56.000 --> 00:14:57.000
In that case.

00:14:57.000 --> 00:15:00.000
It'll be our pleasure.

00:15:03.150 --> 00:15:05.000
Current location?

00:15:05.000 --> 00:15:09.000
They're on the freeway, heading for New York.

00:15:09.600 --> 00:15:13.000
Ah--wait--they made a right.

00:15:13.550 --> 00:15:16.000
Atlantic City?

00:15:21.200 --> 00:15:22.800
What's going on?

00:15:22.800 --> 00:15:27.000
The guys who picked up the Prince were most likely hired by Raginei.

00:15:27.300 --> 00:15:29.500
They'll probably take him by boat...

00:15:30.200 --> 00:15:31.500
Hurry!

00:15:35.550 --> 00:15:37.000
Atlantic?

00:15:37.400 --> 00:15:41.000
Hey, what is this? New York is the other way.

00:15:41.200 --> 00:15:45.000
Oh really? Hey, bro, did you make a wrong turn?

00:15:45.000 --> 00:15:49.000
Nope. This is the right way...

00:15:49.400 --> 00:15:52.400
because we're escorting Prince Rumaty, right?

00:15:54.000 --> 00:15:57.000
You guys... from Raginei...!

00:15:58.000 --> 00:16:00.000
Your homeland awaits you.

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:02.000
Your Highness...

00:16:10.000 --> 00:16:12.000
Hey, stop!

00:16:15.750 --> 00:16:16.400
Linus!

00:16:16.450 --> 00:16:17.000
Yeah.

00:16:25.000 --> 00:16:28.000
Heh. An easy shot.

00:16:36.200 --> 00:16:37.000
Hold it.

00:16:40.000 --> 00:16:43.000
Pretty rash, aren't you.

00:16:43.000 --> 00:16:46.000
Damn it... little oil baron!

00:16:48.000 --> 00:16:49.000
Quit it!

00:16:49.000 --> 00:16:53.000
I told you, we get a bonus if he makes it to Raginei unharmed.

00:16:53.400 --> 00:16:59.000
Huh. If worst comes to worst our client wouldn't mind a dead body.

00:16:59.800 --> 00:17:04.000
So the next time you try pulling a fast one, you can kiss this world goodbye.

00:17:05.000 --> 00:17:07.000
Dead or alive...

00:17:07.000 --> 00:17:09.000
Hands where I can see 'em!

00:17:09.000 --> 00:17:11.000
My brother?

00:17:12.500 --> 00:17:15.000
John and his men? Are they hurt?

00:17:15.000 --> 00:17:19.000
They'll live, but... they lost them.

00:17:19.000 --> 00:17:22.000
Understood. But the Prince is fine?

00:17:22.000 --> 00:17:26.000
Yes. But this is too dangerous. Master, please come back.

00:17:26.500 --> 00:17:31.500
It is close to Atlantic City. I'll contact you when I know their location.

00:17:33.000 --> 00:17:34.000
Keep going straight.

00:17:34.000 --> 00:17:40.000
Got it.  But... did you know this would happen?

00:17:40.000 --> 00:17:43.000
Telling me to head straight to Atlantic City...

00:17:43.000 --> 00:17:48.000
Well... I've been at it so long, trying to outsmart your opponent becomes second nature.

00:17:48.000 --> 00:17:52.000
Master Lee-Leng... you're really just 19?

00:17:53.000 --> 00:17:55.000
Are you trying to say I look old?

00:17:55.000 --> 00:17:57.000
No, that’s not what I meant.

00:17:57.000 --> 00:18:01.000
What I meant was strength, a sense of command.

00:18:01.000 --> 00:18:04.000
Mimicry. Do you know what that means?

00:18:04.000 --> 00:18:09.000
Well... like insects changing colors, that kind of thing?

00:18:09.500 --> 00:18:14.500
I've been trained all my life to become the leader of the Huangs.

00:18:15.800 --> 00:18:21.000
I’ve naturally mimicked what was needed…an entrepreneur, an expert on politics…

00:18:23.500 --> 00:18:25.000
However...

00:18:25.000 --> 00:18:30.000
I've spent so much time mimicking others, I can no longer remember who I really am.

00:18:49.000 --> 00:18:50.000
This is it, this car.

00:18:50.000 --> 00:18:52.000
This camera is in section 52.

00:18:58.400 --> 00:19:01.000
Just like you said, they were on the security camera.

00:19:01.000 --> 00:19:04.000
Turn off the lights and get out of the car.

00:19:08.000 --> 00:19:09.000
Is that it?

00:19:09.000 --> 00:19:14.000
Probably... but they might have the Prince somewhere else.

00:19:14.000 --> 00:19:18.000
We need to be sure. Do you have a gun?

00:19:18.000 --> 00:19:21.000
What? We’re not waiting for the backup?

00:19:21.000 --> 00:19:24.000
The kidnappers know we'll find them if they stay here too long.

00:19:24.700 --> 00:19:26.000
However.

00:19:27.200 --> 00:19:28.000
That's...

00:19:28.400 --> 00:19:34.000
One of the arts of self-defense. Handier than a gun in close combat.

00:19:34.000 --> 00:19:37.000
I'll be fine. Focus on the Prince.

00:19:37.500 --> 00:19:38.000
Right.

00:19:38.000 --> 00:19:39.000
Let's go.

00:20:04.800 --> 00:20:06.000
The Prince...

00:20:07.850 --> 00:20:09.000
Master Lee-Leng.

00:20:09.300 --> 00:20:13.000
There is one in the other room, but other than that…

00:20:13.000 --> 00:20:15.000
Just as John and his men said.

00:20:15.000 --> 00:20:19.950
But, I can hear their voices…it seems the pickup is in 15 minutes.

00:20:19.950 --> 00:20:22.000
What?

00:20:23.250 --> 00:20:24.000
Zao?

00:20:25.000 --> 00:20:27.000
Master Lee-Leng! Where are you?

00:20:27.000 --> 00:20:31.000
The Atlantic City marina. I've found the kidnapper's hideout.

00:20:32.000 --> 00:20:36.000
Answer briefly. How long will it take for the nearest personnel to get here?

00:20:36.550 --> 00:20:38.000
At least 20 minutes...

00:20:38.800 --> 00:20:41.000
Too bad. That won't be good enough.

00:20:41.350 --> 00:20:45.000
Master Lee-Leng... you can't! Please wait!

00:20:45.000 --> 00:20:47.000
I'm going to rescue the Prince.

00:20:47.000 --> 00:20:49.600
Master Lee-Leng. Ma--

00:20:49.600 --> 00:20:54.000
You go to the front and lure one of them out while I enter from the back.

00:20:54.450 --> 00:20:59.000
Whatever you hear, stay glued to that door. Look out for any ambush.

00:20:59.900 --> 00:21:01.700
But the keys...

00:21:01.700 --> 00:21:06.000
I only need ten seconds to pick a lock like that. Now go.

00:21:06.000 --> 00:21:08.000
Roger.

00:21:11.200 --> 00:21:13.000
Such a bright night.

00:21:14.200 --> 00:21:16.000
The full moon...

00:21:16.550 --> 00:21:19.000
doesn't bode well for our side.

00:21:25.600 --> 00:21:27.000
I’m impressed, Your Highness.

00:21:27.300 --> 00:21:30.500
Does this mean you've accepted your fate?

00:21:30.600 --> 00:21:32.300
Is this my brother's will?

00:21:32.300 --> 00:21:33.550
Huh?

00:21:33.550 --> 00:21:35.300
The order... was it my brother's?

00:21:35.500 --> 00:21:38.000
The will of King Somand?

00:21:38.450 --> 00:21:43.000
I wonder... it'd be tough for him not to know about it, huh?

00:21:43.000 --> 00:21:46.000
That's not true! My brother has nothing to do with this!

00:21:46.350 --> 00:21:48.000
Hold still!

00:21:50.400 --> 00:21:54.000
He doesn't know. My brother...

00:21:54.200 --> 00:21:59.000
He doesn't know anything, anything at all.

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:03.000
Who's there?

00:22:03.000 --> 00:22:06.000
Sorry to bother you so late. This is the manager.

00:22:07.000 --> 00:22:09.000
Damn…keep an eye on him, okay?

00:22:25.500 --> 00:22:27.000
Linus!?

00:22:28.400 --> 00:22:30.000
Your Highness. Hurry!

00:22:30.450 --> 00:22:32.000
Oh, Lee-Leng.

00:22:36.000 --> 00:22:37.000
Lee-Leng!

00:22:49.500 --> 00:22:51.000
Stop!

00:22:51.000 --> 00:22:54.000
Don't kill him! I'll go home, I'll go quietly!

00:22:55.000 --> 00:22:58.000
Just don't kill him!

00:22:58.250 --> 00:23:01.000
Prince...

00:23:02.000 --> 00:23:08.000
The distance I feel gives me sorrow,

00:23:08.000 --> 00:23:16.000
So I'm starting to search for your heart.

00:23:16.000 --> 00:23:23.000
Because you were always at my side, protecting me.

00:23:23.000 --> 00:23:28.000
And I'm afraid of being alone.

00:23:30.000 --> 00:23:37.000
Though it's been a long time, everyone's just the same.

00:23:37.000 --> 00:23:45.000
Whether sleeping now, or crying, I want to see your smiling face.

00:23:45.000 --> 00:23:52.000
Because I will love you, with heart overflowing.

00:23:52.000 --> 00:23:59.000
Don't turn away, look at me. I believe in you.

00:23:59.000 --> 00:24:07.000
So, no one else know the secret thoughts of the two of us.

00:24:07.000 --> 00:24:14.000
The blue sea of a strong and beautiful time.

00:24:14.000 --> 00:24:21.000
In those arms, in that breast, I'm alive.
